": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "2f5232534e2660d3f8624d84994c4f2eaa61db7c3d0d9795066166ccf6c5bdfc", "role": "user", "sequence": 4}, {"character_range": [0, 196], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "5a5fbe636b634cdd4f5ee2300a0427137d82e81aef5097a205ec533a429a9072", "role": "user", "sequence": 7}, {"character_range": [0, 42], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "88250d66272d70eb17f8533f7ef2a59c6378cc9f270538c7c9638f078bb997a6", "role": "user", "sequence": 10}, {"character_range": [0, 38], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "413f275d92a5df29c024de84c9d1675166ce067bfdfea94fd08e186eb755f86e", "role": "user", "sequence": 13}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/错题知识网络/可视化错题详情/高等数学/GS-670\\_102450椭球伸缩换元球面坐标.md 这题的隐含条件我倒是看出来了。这题要算三重积分对吧？\n\n我大概的想法是：通过换元将 x² + 4y² + z² 转换成我们熟知的形式（我知道 x² + y² + z² = r²）。把它变成 x² + y² + z² 等于一个 r² 之后，被积函数就变成了 1 - (x² + 4y² + z²)，在这里面化为 1 - r²。\n\n然后换成球面坐标系去做（或者用直角坐标系 dx dy dz 去做）。做的时候：\n• θ 的积分基本是从 0 到 2π dθ\n• φ（或 α）的积分是从 0 到 π dα\n• r 的范围是从 0 到几我也搞不清楚\n\n反正这题很乱，你看我这题是哪个求解步骤有问题？"}